WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Step 1: Upgrade from the trial and add balance. A trial can only text up to 5 verified numbers.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Step 2: In the Console open Account, API keys and tokens, and click Create API key.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Step 3: Name it, for example RevOps agent.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Step 4: Set Key type to Standard. It can't manage your keys, account settings or subaccounts.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Step 5: Click Create.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Step 6: Copy the SID (it starts SK).

7
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Step 7: Copy the secret now. Twilio shows it once.

8
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Step 8: Your Account SID (it starts AC) is on the same page, under Live credentials.

9
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Step 9: In your centre, paste the Account SID, the key SID and the secret.

10
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Step 10: Click Connect Twilio. The agent checks the key by listing your numbers.
